rooms_desc ({"You have arrived in transporter room three of the Federation StarshipEnterprise. As you look around you see Chief O'Brien working at the controlpanel. To the north is the transporter platform you arrived on. To theeast you can see the shuttle bay, and to the west is a corridor that leads to the rest of the Enterprise.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
