items ({({"o'brien","Chief O'Brien is the operator of the transporter room, he is wearing a yellow starfleet uniform. If you wish to leave the Enterprise O'Brien can beam you off","control panel","The transporter control panel is a sophisticated piece of equipment that lets O'Brien easily operate the transporters","platform","The hexagonal platform can transport up to six people and equipment at a time",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
